WEBVTT

00:02.270 --> 00:05.820
We gotta pick a class rep tomorrow. 
Can I nominate you, Umi-chan?

00:05.820 --> 00:08.100
I'd choose you, too!

00:08.100 --> 00:10.630
I'll do my best if I'm picked.

00:19.550 --> 00:22.650
I've got some stuff to do. 
You two head home, okay?

00:34.300 --> 00:36.140
Wh-What?

00:36.140 --> 00:39.740
My name's Asanagi Umi. And you are?

00:39.740 --> 00:45.070
Oh, uh... I'm Yuu. Amami Yuu.

00:45.070 --> 00:47.290
Yuu-chan, huh?

00:48.080 --> 00:49.280
What grade are you in?

00:49.280 --> 00:53.590
Third. I just moved here.

00:54.110 --> 00:58.610
Why were you walking home alone? 
Don't you have any friends in class?

00:58.610 --> 01:01.860
Friends? Well, I...

01:01.860 --> 01:02.710
Don't have any?

01:04.230 --> 01:08.920
Even before I transferred, 
people always avoided me.

01:08.920 --> 01:12.380
They hated that my eye and hair colors 
were different from theirs.

01:14.070 --> 01:18.130
I thought the same thing 
would happen here, too.

01:18.760 --> 01:19.850
So I was too scared to try.

01:19.850 --> 01:21.810
Oh...

01:26.860 --> 01:30.570
Then let's walk home together from now on.

01:31.560 --> 01:33.030
Asanagi-san...

01:36.550 --> 01:40.500
Just call me Umi. And I'll call you Yuu.

01:40.750 --> 01:43.150
Okay, Umi-chan.

01:43.460 --> 01:47.670
That was how Yuu and I became friends—

01:48.290 --> 01:50.800
and where this all began.

03:29.110 --> 03:32.750
I'm Amami Yuu from class 3-1.

03:32.750 --> 03:37.030
Um, it's nice to meet you.

03:38.790 --> 03:41.420
Nice to meet you too, Yuu-chan.

03:41.420 --> 03:44.750
Yeah! You're so pretty and cute!

03:45.580 --> 03:47.710
That worked out, huh, Yuu?

03:48.030 --> 03:50.160
Yep, thanks!

03:50.500 --> 03:54.920
I made two new friends 
thanks to you, Umi!

03:55.260 --> 04:01.140
After that, Yuu came out of her shell, 
her smile bringing joy to all around her.

04:01.140 --> 04:03.720
That part was great.

04:04.600 --> 04:06.550
That part, at least.

04:07.440 --> 04:12.270
Everything started feeling a bit off 
around when we entered middle school.

04:12.600 --> 04:13.940
Umi!

04:15.470 --> 04:17.950
I'm so glad we're in the same class again!

04:18.430 --> 04:21.940
Sanae-chan, Manaka-chan, 
I'm sad you two aren't with us,

04:21.940 --> 04:24.410
but let's all eat lunch together, okay?

04:25.170 --> 04:26.680
Yeah, yeah.

04:26.680 --> 04:29.260
You never change, do you?

04:29.260 --> 04:31.100
Keep clinging to Umi-chan like that,

04:31.100 --> 04:34.000
and the newcomers in middle school 
will laugh at you.

04:34.750 --> 04:39.200
Oh. It won't just be the same 
old gang from today, huh?

04:39.200 --> 04:42.450
Just be yourself, Yuu.

04:44.590 --> 04:45.930
I'm Amami Yuu!

04:46.190 --> 04:48.040
It's nice to meet you!

04:50.890 --> 04:52.980
That must come naturally to her.

04:52.980 --> 04:58.940
I can do it if I have to, but I normally 
don't like being the center of attention.

04:58.940 --> 05:02.580
She's so pretty. 
Like a model or something.

05:02.580 --> 05:05.530
You could brag about being friends 
with someone like that.

05:05.530 --> 05:10.000
I didn't fully understand the implications
of what they were saying at the time.

05:10.420 --> 05:15.670
But even I'd caught on 
by the time we'd hit third year.

05:16.050 --> 05:18.760
That's Yuu-chan's best friend.

05:18.760 --> 05:22.180
Her? She's kinda plain.

05:22.180 --> 05:24.260
She doesn't look right next to Yuu-chan.

05:24.740 --> 05:29.700
Yuu had become the star of our year, 
and I was her best friend.

05:29.700 --> 05:33.560
So many people were envious 
of the position I was in.

05:34.680 --> 05:37.520
Oh, are you free next weekend?

05:38.510 --> 05:41.610
I got four free tickets to a movie.

05:41.890 --> 05:46.120
We haven't hung out as a group lately, 
so let's get Yuu and go see it together.

05:47.030 --> 05:50.110
Oh, sorry. I have plans.

05:50.740 --> 05:51.580
Me, too.

05:51.580 --> 05:53.620
Sorry, Umi-chan.

05:53.620 --> 05:55.100
All good.

05:58.090 --> 06:00.740
It wouldn't feel right to just invite Yuu.

06:00.740 --> 06:03.070
Meh, I don't mind going by myself.

06:03.070 --> 06:05.820
Over here, Yuu-chan!

06:08.620 --> 06:10.600
Sorry! Did you wait long?

06:11.390 --> 06:12.570
Took you long enough.

06:12.570 --> 06:13.560
I'm sorry, okay?

06:17.470 --> 06:20.360
I wish Umi could've joined us.

06:20.660 --> 06:22.830
She said she had plans, right?

06:24.520 --> 06:25.320
Yeah.

06:25.320 --> 06:28.910
It seems she wants 
to focus on her studies.

06:29.180 --> 06:31.340
She's probably trying 
not to go out too much.

06:31.340 --> 06:35.830
If Umi's worried about her grades, 
where does that leave me?

06:36.480 --> 06:41.300
Anyway, all that happened 
before we hit high school.

06:41.300 --> 06:43.620
No way... Then...

06:43.620 --> 06:47.850
When you said you had to transfer out 
because the tuition was too high...

06:47.850 --> 06:51.730
That was a lie. I made up 
a plausible-sounding reason,

06:51.730 --> 06:54.500
but the truth is that 
I wanted to escape from it all.

06:54.500 --> 06:57.440
But you ended up coming with me anyway.

06:57.440 --> 07:00.540
I mean, you're my best friend!

07:00.540 --> 07:03.280
I care about Sanae-chan 
and Manaka-chan too,

07:03.280 --> 07:06.740
but you'll always be 
number one to me, Umi!

07:07.020 --> 07:09.510
I think that was the problem.

07:09.510 --> 07:10.330
What?

07:10.910 --> 07:16.520
I'm glad you can say that about me, 
but it only ended up hurting me.

07:19.460 --> 07:25.450
I actually talked to Sanae and Manaka 
about it on the day of our graduation.

07:25.920 --> 07:29.890
TACHIBANA GIRLS' ACADEMY
GRADUATION CEREMONY

07:26.690 --> 07:29.890
They wanted to get closer 
to you than I was.

07:30.710 --> 07:32.430
And that's why they did it, they said.

07:36.030 --> 07:43.020
You were a popular girl, but I was pretty 
much the only one you called a friend,

07:43.460 --> 07:47.320
so our classmates and stuff 
always looked at me with envy.

07:47.590 --> 07:51.770
Did you realize? All the girls 
who talked to me at first

07:51.770 --> 07:55.830
gradually started only talking to you.

07:57.580 --> 08:01.360
So, the reason you didn't tell 
Amami-san about me...

08:01.360 --> 08:06.670
Yeah. I didn't want Yuu to take the one 
friend I'd finally made for myself, too.

08:08.520 --> 08:09.590
Tell me, Yuu.

08:11.540 --> 08:13.290
Do you like me?

08:13.990 --> 08:15.640
Of course I do!

08:15.640 --> 08:19.140
I've loved you from the day we met! 
You're my best friend forever!

08:19.680 --> 08:23.790
Yeah, I still love you to bits, too.

08:24.190 --> 08:25.730
But at the same time...

08:26.140 --> 08:28.590
I also hate you just as much.

08:29.470 --> 08:30.370
Umi...

08:31.390 --> 08:34.320
Sorry. Let me go cool off for a bit.

08:34.320 --> 08:35.200
Wait, Umi...

08:45.950 --> 08:49.140
Amami-san, I'm going to go after Asanagi.

08:49.140 --> 08:50.380
Maki-kun.

08:50.380 --> 08:53.600
There's some stuff 
I still want to say to her.

09:04.150 --> 09:04.860
Heya.

09:07.290 --> 09:10.520
What're you wallowing in your 
misery for? It's not like you.

09:10.520 --> 09:11.700
Oh, shut it.

09:16.620 --> 09:19.140
You really are incredible.

09:19.780 --> 09:24.540
I can't believe you kept all of that 
bottled up inside for so long.

09:24.540 --> 09:27.880
You did good. Attagirl.

09:30.190 --> 09:33.760
That's right. I did great.

09:34.410 --> 09:38.220
So give me some more credit.

09:43.550 --> 09:44.380
Yeah.

10:00.760 --> 10:01.660
Yuu-chin?

10:04.510 --> 10:06.290
Were you having a moment?

10:07.450 --> 10:09.250
I was thinking about something.

10:09.250 --> 10:11.040
Now that's rare.

10:11.730 --> 10:16.550
I know. And it sounds like 
I need to be more mindful.

10:19.080 --> 10:20.290
Yeah?

10:23.210 --> 10:28.780
Ugh, I'm such a jerk. The worst.

10:28.780 --> 10:31.820
Do you hate yourself or something?

10:31.820 --> 10:33.690
Why wouldn't I?

10:33.690 --> 10:38.650
Ultimately, I did the same thing to Yuu 
that I hated being done to me.

10:38.650 --> 10:44.040
I lied, kept our friendship a secret, 
and left her out of the fun.

10:45.830 --> 10:47.800
How can I fix this?

10:48.550 --> 10:51.720
Some space might be a good idea.

10:52.260 --> 10:53.660
What do you mean?

10:53.660 --> 10:55.060
Between the two of us, that is.

10:55.700 --> 10:59.560
I know you and Amami-san want to make up.

10:59.990 --> 11:04.300
And if it's going to take time, 
I want you to prioritize that first.

11:04.890 --> 11:07.440
Oh, we just won't be hanging out.

11:07.790 --> 11:10.540
I'm not saying we should 
stop being friends.

11:10.540 --> 11:11.650
But then...

11:11.650 --> 11:14.620
We're classmates, so we'll 
still see each other every day.

11:14.620 --> 11:16.820
And we can keep texting as always.

11:17.130 --> 11:20.330
Plus, we have the school festival 
committee rep excuse,

11:20.670 --> 11:23.050
so it wouldn't be weird 
even if we talked in class—

11:23.750 --> 11:29.840
Don't just dump all your thoughts on me! 
Slow down and hear me out, okay?

11:31.230 --> 11:32.190
Sorry.

11:35.190 --> 11:38.300
Tell me how you really feel, Maehara.

11:38.950 --> 11:39.620
Okay.

11:40.010 --> 11:43.010
Would you miss me if you couldn't 
hang out with me anymore?

11:43.340 --> 11:44.380
Well...

11:45.310 --> 11:48.020
Of course I'd miss you.

11:48.020 --> 11:51.480
Do you want us to stay this way?

11:51.480 --> 11:56.490
I do, and I want you to make up 
with Amami-san, too.

11:57.890 --> 12:00.950
Yikes. Now that's a tall order.

12:01.970 --> 12:02.800
But...

12:03.160 --> 12:09.750
Yeah, I get how you feel. 
Thanks for telling me straight up.

12:09.750 --> 12:12.160
You're welcome.

12:12.160 --> 12:14.590
So, have you decided 
what you're going to do?

12:15.070 --> 12:17.480
I'm not totally sure yet, but yeah.

12:29.980 --> 12:33.530
You and Maki-kun have 
gotten awfully close, huh?

12:34.290 --> 12:35.070
Yeah.

12:35.630 --> 12:38.360
It only happened very recently,

12:38.360 --> 12:40.930
but as a friend, he means a lot to me.

12:41.790 --> 12:43.580
More than me, you mean?

12:45.270 --> 12:49.160
You both mean a lot to me. 
There's no ranking here.

12:50.550 --> 12:54.380
Yuu, I'm really sorry 
I didn't tell you sooner.

12:55.350 --> 12:56.880
You should be.

12:56.880 --> 13:01.280
Umi, you idiot! Do you have 
any idea how scared I was?

13:01.280 --> 13:06.990
I was afraid you didn't see me 
as a friend anymore!

13:07.510 --> 13:12.100
Maki-kun's smarter and 
nicer than me, after all...

13:12.870 --> 13:14.490
Sorry, Yuu.

13:14.490 --> 13:19.610
I can't believe I made you feel 
this way. I'm such a fool.

13:21.320 --> 13:27.340
What does that make me, then? I never knew
you were agonizing over all that stuff.

13:27.340 --> 13:33.130
And I kept making you baby me 
for so long. So I need to apologize, too.

13:34.880 --> 13:36.840
Listen, Yuu.

13:37.150 --> 13:40.680
I'm thinking that Maehara 
and I should take a break.

13:40.680 --> 13:43.390
What? Maki-kun?

13:43.730 --> 13:45.680
Are you really okay with that?

13:46.170 --> 13:49.600
I want to respect Asanagi's wishes.

13:50.950 --> 13:52.440
I see.

13:52.760 --> 13:57.650
Umi and Maki-kun, you two are such idiots.

13:58.030 --> 14:04.110
Sorry, Yuu. But I feel like I won't 
get anywhere unless we do that.

14:04.450 --> 14:10.910
I need us to be friends and equals,
rather than best friends in name alone.

14:11.830 --> 14:14.120
So you're serious about this.

14:14.460 --> 14:19.200
Yeah, I'm not lying this time. I mean it.

14:19.200 --> 14:21.700
Fine, if that's what you want...

14:23.460 --> 14:26.720
As if! I'm not letting you!

14:27.020 --> 14:27.800
Huh?

14:27.800 --> 14:31.260
I mean, I'd feel bad for Maki-kun!

14:31.260 --> 14:35.810
How can I hog you all to myself when 
he wants to hang out with you, too?

14:35.810 --> 14:39.770
That'd just mean that 
he and I switched roles!

14:39.770 --> 14:42.580
I won't allow it! Ever!

14:42.580 --> 14:45.120
But then nothing will change...

14:45.120 --> 14:46.120
Jeez!

14:46.950 --> 14:48.120
It's okay!

14:48.750 --> 14:52.910
I want you two to do 
something for me in return.

14:54.810 --> 14:59.770
If you wanna be friends with me for real, 
you'll do what I'm about to say.

15:02.360 --> 15:04.170
That jerk!

15:04.820 --> 15:08.340
Go check out the school festival, 
and hold hands while you do it!

15:08.340 --> 15:10.930
You'd better enjoy it.

15:11.370 --> 15:14.140
I didn't know she had this side to her!

15:14.630 --> 15:16.560
She's pretty.

15:15.050 --> 15:19.110
They probably think she's doing this 
for a dare. Not that far off, actually.

15:20.920 --> 15:23.880
Hey, Nina! Who said you could take pics?!

15:23.880 --> 15:25.820
I'll send 'em to you later!

15:25.820 --> 15:26.860
Get back here!

15:27.630 --> 15:30.370
She's getting dinged 
on the forehead for sure!

15:30.370 --> 15:34.370
HAUNTED HOUSE
ENTRANCE

15:31.790 --> 15:34.370
Hey, they have a haunted house. 
Let's check it out.

15:34.620 --> 15:37.500
Uh, I don't really like those.

15:37.500 --> 15:41.250
And you call yourself a fan 
of B-grade horror? Please.

15:45.590 --> 15:49.360
Don't leave me, Asanagi!

15:50.950 --> 15:53.520
Way to live up to expectations, Maehara.

15:53.520 --> 15:55.700
You're heartless.

15:55.700 --> 15:56.520
For you.

15:57.030 --> 15:58.650
Gee, thanks.

16:02.820 --> 16:05.960
Hey, you can see the 
mosaic art from here, too.

16:06.570 --> 16:09.570
It really is pretty cool, huh?

16:09.570 --> 16:12.410
Yeah, we did great.

16:13.580 --> 16:15.920
You never know, we might actually win.

16:16.500 --> 16:17.830
SCHOOL FEST

16:20.320 --> 16:24.020
And so, our eventful school 
festival came to an end.

16:26.910 --> 16:28.260
Uh...

16:28.260 --> 16:29.860
The usual?

16:29.860 --> 16:35.590
Yeah. Oh, but I'm in the mood 
for lots of milk and sugar today.

16:35.590 --> 16:40.070
Gotcha. I-I'll have the same, then.

16:44.590 --> 16:47.690
Don't mind me. I'm just a ghost.

16:49.870 --> 16:53.380
Go check out the school festival, 
and hold hands while you do it!

16:53.380 --> 16:55.660
You'd better enjoy it.

16:55.660 --> 16:57.450
Wh-What?

16:57.450 --> 16:58.770
You mean, like, now?

16:58.770 --> 17:01.550
Yup! Oh, and one more thing...

17:02.130 --> 17:07.800
I wanna see what you two get up to 
during your secret hangouts.

17:09.070 --> 17:10.800
Hey, wait! Timeout!

17:10.800 --> 17:11.860
Let me go, please?

17:11.860 --> 17:12.610
Nope.

17:13.030 --> 17:13.550
Hi-yah!

17:13.550 --> 17:15.100
Hey! You didn't!

17:15.100 --> 17:18.920
Sorry, my hand went rogue.

17:18.920 --> 17:19.850
Why, you little...

17:23.620 --> 17:26.930
Huh? What's wrong, Asanagi-san?

17:26.930 --> 17:29.160
Not doing too good today, are we?

17:30.070 --> 17:32.280
We're going another round, you dumbass!

17:32.280 --> 17:32.990
Yeah, yeah.

17:32.990 --> 17:34.150
Whatever you say.

17:38.840 --> 17:40.500
Gah! I'm done!

17:40.870 --> 17:42.850
I'm never playing this crap again!

17:42.850 --> 17:45.620
I eagerly await your next challenge.

17:45.620 --> 17:49.560
You punk... I'll show you 
who's boss next time.

17:49.560 --> 17:52.010
You've got a week to plan your funeral.

17:52.010 --> 17:55.080
Bring it on, next week or whenever.

17:55.680 --> 17:56.470
Urk.

17:56.860 --> 17:57.740
Oh.

17:59.180 --> 18:01.240
Oh, for the love of...

18:04.950 --> 18:08.480
What's the matter? Why do you want 
to talk to your friendly ghost?

18:11.480 --> 18:16.360
I'm sorry, Yuu. Hanging out 
with Maehara is just too much fun.

18:16.360 --> 18:18.660
I know I said we'd take 
a break for a while,

18:18.970 --> 18:22.250
but I know I can't handle 
not seeing him right now.

18:23.270 --> 18:28.090
Do you mind if I keep 
giving my Fridays to him?

18:28.090 --> 18:31.220
I know it'll make you sad, 
and I'm sorry for that.

18:31.670 --> 18:33.780
Yeah, that's fine.

18:33.780 --> 18:37.370
In return, you can indulge me 
more than you ever have.

18:41.670 --> 18:45.270
And we'll talk about 
lots and lots of things.

18:45.720 --> 18:49.580
Got it. Thanks, Yuu.

18:50.590 --> 18:54.900
Now, this ghostly third wheel 
shall take her leave.

18:54.900 --> 18:57.050
I'll head out with you.

18:58.020 --> 19:01.680
You stay here and chill 
some more with Maki-kun.

19:02.090 --> 19:04.620
You'd like that too, right, Maki-kun?

19:04.620 --> 19:07.580
Nah, I'm beat. I wouldn't really mind...

19:07.580 --> 19:09.540
You'd like that too, right?

19:11.170 --> 19:12.840
R-Right...

19:13.760 --> 19:18.140
And now... I reel it in!

19:19.100 --> 19:21.180
You okay, Maehara?

19:21.180 --> 19:24.750
Yeah. My nose just got a bit ticklish.

19:26.040 --> 19:27.710
You don't sound okay.

19:27.710 --> 19:30.440
If you were cold, 
why didn't you just say so?

19:32.910 --> 19:34.640
Come over here.

19:35.030 --> 19:35.980
Uh, what?

19:35.980 --> 19:37.530
Don't give me that.

19:37.850 --> 19:40.620
I'm offering you a privilege! 
Get over here!

19:42.480 --> 19:44.410
P-Pardon me.

19:44.410 --> 19:46.050
Hold the other end.

19:46.050 --> 19:47.120
Okay.

19:51.010 --> 19:52.930
Hey, Maehara...

19:52.930 --> 19:53.840
What?

19:54.730 --> 19:56.710
Can I call you Maki?

19:58.790 --> 20:01.060
I-If you want to, Umi.

20:03.100 --> 20:03.590
Hi-yah!

20:03.590 --> 20:04.350
Ow!

20:04.350 --> 20:06.280
Wh-What was that for?

20:06.280 --> 20:08.620
Getting too big for your britches, Maki.

20:08.620 --> 20:12.150
That's unreasonable. 
All I did was call you by your name.

20:13.750 --> 20:17.740
That's just the kind of girl I am! 
Get used to it!

20:20.370 --> 20:22.100
Listen, Umi...

20:23.050 --> 20:26.660
I don't say these things too often, 
because they're embarrassing.

20:26.930 --> 20:33.000
But when you smile like you just did, 
you're prettier and cuter than anybody.

20:37.680 --> 20:39.490
Hey, Maki.

20:39.930 --> 20:40.920
What?

20:42.760 --> 20:46.060
You really do like me, don't you?

20:53.190 --> 20:57.320
See ya. Let me know how things went 
with Amami-san next week or something.

20:57.320 --> 20:59.530
Sure. See you next week.

21:00.740 --> 21:02.050
Hey, Maki...

21:02.050 --> 21:02.950
What?

21:04.460 --> 21:06.120
Do you like me?

21:10.590 --> 21:14.750
W-Well, uh, in what way?

21:16.880 --> 21:20.880
O-Oh, yeah? Do you like me, then?

21:21.630 --> 21:25.100
That's what you're basically saying 
when you ask me that!

21:25.870 --> 21:27.180
Hm...

21:27.180 --> 21:30.240
It's complicated, 
now that I actually think about it.

21:31.280 --> 21:34.980
But I don't think I like you, Maki.

21:36.590 --> 21:38.650
You know why?

21:38.650 --> 21:40.650
Because I don't like you...

21:45.000 --> 21:47.330
I love you.

21:49.260 --> 21:53.880
A kiss on the lips can wait until 
you admit that you like me, okay?

21:55.300 --> 21:57.170
Okay, see you next week.

22:01.910 --> 22:05.360
Seriously, that's just not fair.

22:07.100 --> 22:10.770
Translation: Sriram Gurunathan

22:10.770 --> 22:14.160
Subtitle Editing: Geoff Mazzolini
Subtitle Timing: Krzysztof Kunc

22:14.160 --> 22:17.410
Quality Check: Ashley Barboza
Translation Check: David Saylor

23:37.790 --> 23:39.880
"December with Friends."
